  "details": "I have noticed for several days in a row that if I select a lower resolution to take images with the camera and then I select a higher resolution, the camera often reverts back to the lower resolution again on accident.\n\nI am unsure if it reverted when I closed and opened the camera or when I swapped worlds but, specifically, I do photography for events and I lowered the resolution to 720p for a photo and then turned it back up to 4k (the usual I take photos at) and I noticed that my photos were mostly all taken in 720p from that night.\n\nThank you for looking into this.\n\n(On the current open beta build, SteamVR)",
